      "writtenOn": "2024-05-08T08:07:47Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Unprivileged apps can\u0027t use raw sockets. You\u0027d need some call into the networkstack module (presumably protected by NETWORK_SETTINGS) that would send packets for you, or that would return the FileDescriptor of a bound packet socket that you can use to send packets.",
